# 1. Introduction

## Purpose

The purpose of this project is to build a professional digital music business platform that allows artists to:

- Purchase beat licenses.
- Book studio sessions.
- Buy merchandise.
- Download purchased files securely.
- Interact with the producer's brand.

The system also allows administrators to manage every aspect of the business from a secure dashboard.

# 2. Project Overview

UltBigBoy is a music production brand.

The platform combines:

- Beat marketplace
- Digital licensing
- Studio booking
- Merchandise store
- Artist portfolio
- Customer accounts
- Payment processing
- Administration dashboard

The platform should compete with modern beat marketplaces while maintaining its own unique identity.

# 3. Objectives

The platform must:

- Sell digital beats securely.
- Generate licenses automatically.
- Accept online payments.
- Prevent unauthorized downloads.
- Manage studio bookings.
- Sell physical merchandise.
- Provide excellent mobile experience.
- Deliver premium UI/UX with animations.
- Maintain enterprise-level security.

