# 6. Functional Requirements

## 6.1 Homepage

The homepage shall include:

- Animated hero section
- Featured beats
- Latest releases
- Services
- Merchandise
- Testimonials
- Newsletter
- Footer

## 6.2 Beat Marketplace

Users shall be able to:

- Search beats
- Filter by genre
- Filter by mood
- Filter by BPM
- Filter by key
- Sort results
- Preview beats
- Purchase licenses

Each beat shall display:

- Artwork
- BPM
- Key
- Genre
- Duration
- License pricing

## 6.3 Audio Player

Features:

- Play
- Pause
- Seek
- Volume
- Waveform
- Persistent playback
- Mobile controls

Preview files only.

## 6.4 Beat Licensing

Supported licenses:

- Basic
- Premium
- Unlimited
- Exclusive

Each license shall define:

- Usage rights
- Download formats
- Commercial rights
- Distribution limits

After payment:

- Generate license record
- Generate PDF certificate
- Enable downloads

Exclusive licenses shall remove future exclusive purchases automatically.

## 6.5 Customer Accounts

Registration

Required:

- Name
- Email
- Phone
- Password

Features:

- Login
- Logout
- Password reset
- Email verification
- Profile editing

Dashboard sections:

- Purchases
- Downloads
- Licenses
- Orders
- Bookings
- Wishlist
- Notifications

## 6.6 Shopping Cart

The cart shall:

- Add items
- Remove items
- Update quantities
- Calculate totals
- Preserve contents

Checkout shall include:

- Customer information
- Payment
- Order confirmation

## 6.7 Merchandise Store

Features:

- Categories
- Product pages
- Variations
- Stock
- Orders

Admins shall manage inventory.

## 6.8 Studio Booking

Customers shall:

- Choose service
- Choose date
- Choose time
- Pay deposit
- Receive confirmation

The backend shall prevent double bookings.

Admins shall:

- Manage availability
- Confirm bookings
- Reschedule sessions

## 6.9 Custom Beat Requests

Customers shall submit:

- Project description
- Reference links
- Audio samples
- Preferred license

Admins shall manage request status.

## 6.10 Reviews

Customers may submit reviews.

Admins shall:

- Approve
- Reject
- Remove reviews

Only approved reviews appear publicly.

## 6.11 Artist Portfolio

