# 18. Acceptance Criteria

The project is complete only when:

- All pages are responsive.
- Authentication is secure.
- Payments are verified.
- Downloads are protected.
- Bookings prevent conflicts.
- Admin dashboard manages real data.
- Animations are smooth.
- Accessibility passes testing.
- No hardcoded localhost URLs remain.
- No preview-mode authentication remains in production.
- Documentation and deployment instructions are complete.

